# Fortuna Project - Current Context

## 1) Project objective
- Name: `fortuna`
- Purpose: personal financial management desktop application.
- Current state: Electron + React + TypeScript app with typed IPC, generic CRUD handlers, SQLite schema/migrations, and renderer service layer.

## 2) Core architecture
- Runtime: Electron (`main` + `preload` + `renderer`).
- Main process:
  - boots app window and lifecycle (`src/main.ts`)
  - initializes database (`getDb`)
  - runs migrations (`migrateToLatest`)
  - registers IPC handlers (`registerIpcHandlers(db)`).
- Preload:
  - exposes `window.fortuna` via `contextBridge`
  - bridges renderer calls to `ipcRenderer.invoke(...)`
  - CRUD `list` now uses shared `ListInput` (`page`, `pageSize`, `orders`, `filters`).
- Renderer:
  - React + React Router
  - service layer on top of `window.fortuna` (`CrudService` + domain services)
  - i18n with `i18next`/`react-i18next`
  - Bootstrap + Bootstrap Icons.

## 3) Data layer
- DB: SQLite through `better-sqlite3` + Kysely.
- Central schema: `src/database/schema.ts`.
- Migration system:
  - registry table (`migrations`) ensured before versioned runs
  - `migrateTo` / `migrateToLatest` in `src/database/migrator.ts`
  - supports up/down sync by numeric versions
  - current versioned migration: `001_init_app.ts`.
- Covered domains/tables:
  - `users`, `user_settings`
  - `account_types`, `accounts`
  - `category_groups`, `categories`
  - `payees`
  - `transactions`, `transfers`, `recurring_transactions`
  - `credit_cards`, `credit_card_statements`, `credit_card_purchases`, `credit_card_installments`, `credit_card_statement_payments`.

## 4) IPC and CRUD pattern
- Shared contract: `src/shared/ipc.ts` (`RendererApi`, `CrudApi`).
- Generic CRUD registration: `src/shared/handlers/crud/register.crud.ts`.
- CRUD input/output shared types:
  - `ListInput` with `orders[]` and `filters[]`
  - `PaginatedResult<T>`.
- Domain handlers are split per module under `src/shared/handlers/*` and registered centrally in `src/shared/handlers/index.ts`.
- App-level non-CRUD handlers:
  - metadata (`app:get-meta`)
  - locale (`app:get-locale`).

## 5) Renderer layer (current structure)
- Root: `src/renderer/src/App.tsx`
- Router: `src/renderer/src/core/router/index.tsx`
- Services: `src/renderer/src/core/services/*`
  - generic base: `crud.service.ts`
  - domain services: accounts, account-types, categories, transactions, etc.
- i18n:
  - setup: `src/renderer/src/core/i18n/index.ts`
  - resources: `src/renderer/src/core/i18n/resources/en-US.ts`, `pt-BR.ts`.

## 6) Build/dev toolchain
- Language/module: TypeScript + ESM (`"type": "module"`).
- Bundling:
  - main/preload with `tsup`
  - renderer with `vite`
  - renderer artifacts copied to root `dist/` via `scripts/copy-renderer.mjs`.
- Key scripts:
  - `dev`: renderer + preload watch + electron
  - `build`: renderer build + tsup + copy renderer
  - `start`: electron with built output
  - `check`: `tsc --noEmit`
  - `test`: node test runner (`tsx` import)
  - `lint` / `format`.

## 7) TypeScript and aliases
- Strict TS enabled with modern options (`strict`, `isolatedModules`, `verbatimModuleSyntax`, etc.).
- Important aliases:
  - `@db` -> `src/database/index.ts`
  - `@db/schema` -> `src/database/schema.ts`
  - `@shared/*` -> `src/shared/*`
  - `@widgets` -> `src/renderer/src/widgets/index.ts`.

## 8) Current dependencies (high level)
- Runtime: `electron`, `react`, `react-dom`, `react-router-dom`, `kysely`, `better-sqlite3`, `i18next`, `react-i18next`, `bootstrap`, `bootstrap-icons`, `date-fns`.
- Dev: `typescript`, `tsup`, `vite`, `eslint`, `prettier`, `tsx`, `concurrently`, `cross-env`, `wait-on`, `@electron/rebuild`.

## 9) Notes and caveats
- `better-sqlite3` requires Electron ABI rebuild (`npm run rebuild:electron`), also triggered by `postinstall`.
- Linux scripts include `--no-sandbox --disable-setuid-sandbox`.
- DB path behavior by env:
  - dev: `./dev.db`
  - production: `~/.fortuna/fortuna.db`.
- Generic CRUD currently uses some `any` casts internally to simplify Kysely query composition.

## 10) Latest updates
- 2026-05-03:
  - fixed IPC/preload CRUD `list` contract mismatch
  - standardized on shared `ListInput`/`PaginatedResult` in `src/preload.ts` and `src/shared/ipc.ts`.
- 2026-05-01:
  - renderer global styling/icon stack consolidated on Bootstrap + Bootstrap Icons.
